model_losses_l = (model_pred_l - target_l).pow(2).mean(dim=[1,2,3])

model_diff = model_losses_w - model_losses_l
```

This corresponds directly to the derivation and loss formula presented in the Diffusion-DPO paper (see main text Equation (9) and Appendix pseudocode).

